      "beat_id": "B03BATCH",
      "act": "SHOW",
      "heading": "The batch can change the calculation",
      "narration_text": "Horace He and Thinking Machines Lab traced an important source of variation to batching. A server groups requests to process them efficiently. Changing the batch size can change the arithmetic order inside its kernels, the programs that perform the calculations. Server load changes which requests share a batch, so your identical prompt can take a different numerical path.",
